1
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:27,160
An unknown frontier
on the map painted by my heart

2
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:34,060
,When I open the door
the path goes on

3
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:39,970
I'm kicking up dust
as I start running to your town

4
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:46,740
Along a route
where earth and sky meet

5
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:50,280
Riding the rushing southern wind

6
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:53,220
Slicing through the wind
dyed blue by the sky

7
00:00:53,220 --> 00:01:00,360
I'm rushing out
with my whole heart

8
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:04,030
Shooting past the midday moon

9
00:01:04,030 --> 00:01:06,830
Towards a world different
from what we've known before

10
00:01:06,830 --> 00:01:11,000
I will keep on running
through to the end

11
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,600
However far

12
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:21,630
Just like that wind

13
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:55,640
"...أخبار فيما يتعلق بالموقف في هونك كونك"

14
00:02:26,780 --> 00:02:31,040
"مشكلتها"

15
00:02:38,290 --> 00:02:40,660
ما الامر, كنامي؟

16
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:42,780
